      "id": "sol.ahsme-1958-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(2-3=-1,\\) its reciprocal is also \\(-1.\\) Therefore \\[ \\left[2-3(-1)\\right]^{-1} =5^{-1}=\\frac15. \\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is C.",
